     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I have tried to install Distance 6.2 on dell laptop using Windows 7 Enterprise (service pack v 1; 64 bit operating system) and I received an error message indicating me that I can’t overwrite the file “MSVCP60.dll”.  <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Some users seem to have encountered similar problems (<a href=\"https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/112\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/112&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475375704000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2XTw_jHEDpcNoJwtm7uUU0\">https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/112</a>) and I was wondering if a more convenient\r\n solution had been found. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you for your help, Chris<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-------------------<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"FR-CA\" style=\"color:black\">Christian Roy, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FR-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Analyste des populations d’oiseaux migrateurs, Service canadien de la faune, Environnement Canada<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u><span lang=\"FR-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:blue\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"color:blue\">christi...@canada.ca</span></a></span></u><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:navy\">\r\n /</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Téléphone <a href=\"tel:(819)%20938-5418\" value=\"+18199385418\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">819-938-5418</a></span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:navy\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FR\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Migratory bird population analyst,\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">Canadian Wildlife Service, Environment Canada</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u><span lang=\"FR-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:blue\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:blue\">christi...@canada.ca</span></a>\r\n</span></u><span lang=\"FR-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">/ Phone : <a href=\"tel:(819)%20938-5418\" value=\"+18199385418\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">819-938-5418</a></span><u><span lang=\"FR-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:blue\"><u></u><u></u></span></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
